{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The Big Argument"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "On My Own Again"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Should and Be Supposed To "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the modal <span class=\"strong\">should</span> or the structure <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> when you want to talk about expectations, obligations or arrangements."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> to talk about situations in the present or future that are expected to happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure is:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + to be + supposed to + verb"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">I'm supposed to clean the house this afternoon.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br/>**Pronunciation tip**:<br/>When you say <span class=\"italic\">be supposed to</span>, you link the /d/ and /t/ sounds together. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Like this:<br/>Be suppose_to"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I should stop talking now."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm supposed to clean the house this afternoon."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Modals for Possibility and Certainty "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can use modals to talk about degrees of certainty.<br/><br/>You use them to describe what is definite, probable, possible, or impossible from the speaker's point of view. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use must, may, might, and could to describe degrees of certainty.<br/>You can use modals with have + past participle to talk about the possibility of a past event that is not clear in the present context.<br/>Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">She must have found the situation frustrating.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Must = it's very likely<br/>Must not / Could not / Can't = it's not possible<br/>May / Might / Can / Could = it's possible<br/>May not / Might not = it's possible this is not true"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She must have (must've)  found the situation frustrating.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's very likely the situation was frustrating.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">She couldn't stop thinking about him.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It wasn't possible to stop thinking about him.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I can continue now.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's possible to continue now.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I may not be able to finish the story today.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"It's not likely that I can finish the story.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to span"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to last a certain amount of time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This story spans over 6 months."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le01ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear in a conversation about relationships."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "confused"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "unable to think clearly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My mother was shocked and confused that her parents disagreed with the wedding."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le01ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to keep in touch"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to maintain contact with someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My mother kept in touch with my father through my uncle."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le01ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to pretend"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to act so as to show that something is true when it is not "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She pretended to be a friend of my uncle's."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le01ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "girlfriend"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a female companion with whom a person has a romantic relationship"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She pretended to be an old American girlfriend of my uncle's."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le01ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn8le01ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Describe the different expectations for men and for women."}, {"type": "text", "content": "How are men and women supposed to behave? Are they supposed to behave a certain way at work? At home?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 10-12 sentences using <span class=\"italic\">supposed to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">should</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share with your partner and compare results."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about feelings and sensations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about things people are supposed to do and things that are supposed to happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify different types of behavior for men and women."}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "_data": []}, {"_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le01ob02re2aud01", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn8le01ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "0"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hi, Paula!  How was your parents' anniversary party?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: Oh, it was great. Everyone was in such a great mood.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Now can you continue the story about when your parents met?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: Well, I can continue a part of the story, but I may not be able to finish it today.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Really? It's that long?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: It spans over 6 months.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn8le01ob02re2img05.jpg", "time": "100"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Go on.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: Well, my mother was shocked and confused that her parents disagreed with the wedding. She must have found the situation very frustrating.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I would think so.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: My mother tried to be happy living in the United States on her own again, but secretly, she kept her dream of living in Italy alive. She couldn't stop thinking about him. She decided to learn Italian and to keep in touch through my father's brother.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Your uncle.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn8le01ob02re2img02.jpg", "time": "24000"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: Yes. I'm supposed to keep this part secret. She wrote letters to my Uncle Alfredo, pretending to be an old American girlfriend of his who just wanted to practice Italian. In every letter, she asked for information about my father. He thought it was amusing.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: That's so romantic! Keep going!<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: Sorry, Peter. I should stop now. I am supposed to clean the house this afternoon because we may have some guests coming over.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: OK, Paula.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn8le01ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "50500"}], "coverimg": "engenn8le01ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "exercises": [{"_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about feelings and sensations."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about things I am supposed to do and things that are supposed to happen."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can express possibility and certainty. "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Where do your close friends live? Are they all in the same city?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Do you have long-distance friendships or relationships?  How easy is it to keep in touch with these people?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "Long-distance relationships can be tricky&nbsp;..."}], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "template_override": 1, "questions": []}, {"_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Paula talks about how her parents <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">beat the odds</span> by keeping their romance alive despite being apart for a while."}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Content"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Listening"}]}, {"type": "tips", "content": [{"type": "text", "content": "You <span class=\"italic\">\u201cbeat the odds\u201d</span> when you overcome a great difficulty.", "tip_id": 0}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio."}]}], "type": "STI", "stimuli_ids": [1], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 1}]}]}, {"_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " What should Paula be doing now?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Activity 1"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_fe